{"unit_id":"igormel81__dsh-chat-cost#card-zh","repo":"igormel81/dsh-chat-cost","commit":"8b37b31edf63190277690243d505f93715c72739","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-cost 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的费用统计插件，通过主机端会话树读取 token 用量并按内置模型价格计算聊天、子代理和整棵会话树的费用。它在聊天输入区显示总费用，并在每条已完成回答下展示单轮费用；同时提供价格查询、历史统计、预算估算、计划记录和模型路由情景比较工具。适合需要追踪模型开销并为项目规划预算的 DSH 用户。运行时无需账号或 API 密钥，费用日志写入项目目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:123-243","lib/client.js:461-476","lib/tools.js:43-62"]}
{"unit_id":"igormel81__dsh-chat-cost#card-en","repo":"igormel81/dsh-chat-cost","commit":"8b37b31edf63190277690243d505f93715c72739","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chat-cost tracks DSH chat and subagent costs with bundled prices. It shows session spend in the composer and each answer cost below it. Six tools query prices and history, estimate budgets, mark plan work, and compare model routes. No account or key is needed; the ledger is saved in the project.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:123-243","lib/client.js:461-476","lib/tools.js:43-62"]}
